* June 20th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[hurtslxrd]]. <ref name="+hurtslxrd">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CfBpf79Nu4B/|title=Hurtslxrd в стае ARCRED!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Hurtslxrd in the ARCRED pack!|date=2022-06-20|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* December 13th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[eN0o]]. <ref name="-eN0o">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CmHIywtNKKp/|title=После долгих размышлений о итогах выступлений ARCRED в 2022 году, организация приняла решение о замене в CS:GO составе|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=After much thought about the results of ARCRED performances in 2022, the organization has decided to replace the CS:GO roster|date=2022-12-13|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* December 28th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[sm3t]]. <ref name="+sm3t">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6050|title=После многочисленных тестов мы готовы объявить о том что, Матвей "sm3t" Гогин становится новым игроком CS:GO состава ARCRED!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=After numerous tests, we are ready to announce that Matvey "sm3t" Gogin becomes a new CS:GO player of the ARCRED roster!|date=2022-12-28|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>

|content4=
* January 12th - [[sm3t]] leaves '''ARCRED''' to join [[flowstate]]. <ref name="-sm3t">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-213780846_227|title=FLOWSTATE с радостью готовы представить вам 5-ого игрока нашего ростера по CS:GO Матвея "sm3t" Гогина|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=FLOWSTATE is pleased to present you the 5th player of our CS:GO roster Matvey "sm3t" Gogin|date=2023-01-12|author=[[flowstate]]}}</ref>
* January 19th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[t4RG3T]]. <ref name="+t4RG3T">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6058|title=ROSTER UPDATE!|date=2023-01-19|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* May 5th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[t4RG3T]]. <ref name="-t4RG3T">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-152085079_681|title=FFT открыт к предложениям, опорник всех плентов|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=FFT is open to offers, the defender of all bombsites|date=2023-05-05|author=[[t4RG3T]]}}</ref>
* June 3rd - '''ARCRED''' sign [[shg]]. <ref name="+shg">{{cite web|url=https://www.instagram.com/p/CtBoBkeN4yd/|title=ROSTER UPDATE!|date=2023-06-03|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>

|content5=
* January 20th - '''ARCRED''' replace [[hurtslxrd]] with [[synyx]]. <ref name="-hurtslxrd">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6615|title=Сегодня мы прощаемся с Ренатом @hurtslxrd Cапаровым|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Today we say goodbye to Renat @hurtslxrd Saparov|date=2024-01-20|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref><ref name="+synyx">{{cite web|url=https://vk.com/wall-188994701_6616|title=Пополнение в составе ARCRED|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=New members of ARCRED|date=2024-01-20|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* January 25th - '''ARCRED''' replace [[Ryujin]] with [[Get_Jeka]]. <ref name="-Ryujin">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ARCREDesports/status/1750451064044961969|title=See you again Ryujin|date=2024-01-25|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref><ref name="+Get_Jeka">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/ARCREDesports/status/1750523194627457233|title=Introducing the latest player - Get_Jeka|date=2024-01-25|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* September 8th - [[shg]] steps down from the active lineup due to health reasons. <ref name="shg inactive">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/arcredofficial/2442|title=Произошли временные изменения в нашей команде по CS2!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=There have been some temporary changes to our CS2 team!|date=2024-09-08|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* November 11th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[synyx]]. <ref name="-synyx">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1855941321128820881|title=It's time to say goodbye!|date=2024-11-11|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>

|content6=
