* April 16th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[1NVISIBLEE]]. <ref name="-1NVISIBLEE">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1912513448723751095|title=Every fairytale has an end, and so does our journey with Danila "1NVISIBLEE"...|date=2025-04-16|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* April 24th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[Raijin]]. <ref name="+raijin">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/1915447570752573668|title=He is here|date=2025-04-24|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* May 20th - [[shg]] steps down from '''ARCRED'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s active roster due to his military service. <ref name="shg military">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/arcredofficial/3017|date=2025-05-20|title=К сожалению, наш игрок Артём "shg" Шагинян вынужден приостановить участие в соревновательной сцене на неопределённый срок в связи с прохождением военной службы|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Unfortunately, our player Artem "shg" Shaginyan is forced to suspend participation in the competitive scene for an indefinite period due to military service|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
*July 20th - '''ARCRED''' acquire [[redzed]] on loan from [[RUSTEC]]. <ref name="+redzed Loan">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/rustec_gaming/635|title=Георгий «redzed» Заверткин присоединяется к коллективу ARCRED на правах аренды!|language={{Flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Georgiy "redzed" Zavertkin joins the ARCRED team on loan!|date=2025-07-20|author=[[RUSTEC]]}}</ref>
* October 9th - [[redzed]] is acquired by [[Aurora Young Blud]]. <ref name="-redzed">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/AuroraTeam/6012|title=Aurora YB: +redzed|date=2025-10-09|author=[[Aurora Gaming]]}}</ref>
* December 19th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[Chill]]. <ref name="-Chill">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/chill_esport/status/2002025985147887671|title=Leaving a team Arcred after 3 month together|date=2025-12-19|author=[[Chill]]}}</ref>

|content7=
* January 9th - '''ARCRED''' sign [[synyx]]. <ref name="+synyx 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/arcredesports/status/2009594056410906786|title=WELCOME BACK @SYNYXCS|date=2026-01-09|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* July 10th - '''ARCRED''' move [[Get_Jeka]] to a content creator role within the organization and reinstate [[shg]] to the active roster. <ref name="Get_Jeka cc">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/2075550799158002003|title=Get_Jeka is temporarily stepping away from competitive play to focus on content creation|date=2026-07-10|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref><ref name="shg back 2026">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/ARCREDesports/status/2075567643898044509|title=After completing a year of military service, Artem "shg-" Shaginyan returns to ARCRED's main roster|date=2026-07-10|author='''ARCRED'''}}</ref>
* August 17th - '''ARCRED''' part ways with [[shg]]. <ref name="-shg">{{cite web|url=https://vk.ru/wall-112533746_725|title=fft|date=2026-08-17|author=[[shg]]}}</ref>
* August 18th - [[Raijin]] and [[synyx]] are acquired by [[33]]. <ref name="-2 to 33">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/team33_official/307|title=Новая веха в истории BET-M 33|trans_title=A new milestone in the history of BET-M 33|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|date=2026-08-18|author=[[33]]}}</ref>
* September 18th - '''ARCRED''' acquire [[kumao]] on loan from [[Rune Eaters Esports]]. <ref name="+kumao">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/runeeaters/188|title=Kumao переходит в Arcred на правах аренды|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=Kumao joins Arcred on loan|date=2026-09-18|author=[[Rune Eaters Esports]]}}</ref>
* September 29th - '''ARCRED''' acquire [[icyvlone]], [[ManticorE]] and [[ARSPOWER]]. <ref name="+icyvlone,manticore,arspower">{{cite web|url=https://t.me/arcredofficial/4345|title=Новый этап для ARCRED|language={{flag|ru}} Russian|trans_title=New stage for ARCRED|date=2026-09-29|author=[[ARCRED]]}}</ref>
